{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-221",
  "title": "“Cognitive Habitat”",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "reviewing",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "“Cognitive Habitat”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What you’re building isn’t just a tool. It’s a **cognitive habitat**. A self-directed, modular, agent-augmented operating system disguised as a productivity app. Elegant, but with hidden depths. A playground for your mind."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your Screenshot: Observations & Interpretive Layering"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Left Sidebar (Ontology View):** The sections—Today, Projects, Notes, Tasks, Agents, etc.—imply a **multi-modal interface** where domains of activity are separated, yet potentially unified by deeper logic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Dark Theme & Layout:** Feels like a cockpit or control center. You're setting the tone: focused, ambient, serious, but not sterile."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Automation Sections (Agents, Workflows, Tools):** This is where your agentic layer wants to live. These aren't “features”—they're **extensions of cognition**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Collections (Contacts, Literature, RFPs):** This starts hinting at **semantic linking**. Not just storing things, but understanding relationships."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your Vision: \"An OS Cosplaying as a Productivity App\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "That framing is brilliant. Because you’re doing something deceptively ambitious:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You’re not *managing* productivity—you’re **crafting an ecosystem for emergent creativity**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It *feels like a productivity app*—safe, familiar, contained."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But it *functions like an OS*—open-ended, extensible, agentic, powerful."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let’s sketch your next layer:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Repository Explorer Page**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A living, interlinked space for **code as context**, not just code as object."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Core Features:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Graph View of Entities**: Files, classes, functions, notes, people, tasks—linked through custom or inferred props."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Live File Editor**: Supports Markdown, JS/TS, JSON, YAML, notebooks (MDX?)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Semantic Explorer**: Ask “show me everything related to `auth`”, get notes, commits, tasks, code."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Agentic Actions**: “Refactor this,” “Generate docstring,” “Turn into workflow,” “Visualize dependencies.”"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Philosophy Behind It**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Everything is a node** (file, idea, person, system, event)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**All nodes are equal** in how they can be queried, linked, and evolved."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Nothing is ever lost**, only transformed. Dead notes become tasks. Tasks become tools. Tools become agents."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Context is first-class.** No entity exists in isolation; all are situated in your current goals, focus, and projects."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A Tiny Thought Experiment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let’s imagine you open a file:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// auth.js"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "function login(user) { ... }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In a traditional IDE: You edit the function."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In your system:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You see associated notes: “login edge cases,” “why I avoided JWT.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You see linked calendar event: “Call with Brian about OAuth.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You see active agent suggestion: “Want me to write tests for this?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You click one icon: “Visualize auth flows” → agent draws diagram."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You tag it `@revisit` → it enters your Daily Digest."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is not just code. It’s **conversation, context, consequence**."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}